# A PZSz ingest report (PPS, MPS) lists every skipped starter with the birth
# year from the PZSz start list: personal data of people who are not ours, many
# of them young. It goes to Storage and Telegram on CERT; the LOCAL copy is never
# committed (public repository, ADR-111).
doc/staging/PPS*
doc/staging/MPS*
